WEBVTT

00:00.170 --> 00:02.976
Follow one tooth through an ordinary day.

00:05.170 --> 00:10.159
When we eat or drink something sugary,
bacteria in plaque use those

00:10.159 --> 00:10.575
sugars.

00:11.170 --> 00:15.441
Sipping sweet drinks repeatedly gives
bacteria more chances to make

00:15.441 --> 00:17.150
acid that attacks enamel.

00:18.170 --> 00:20.214
Try water between meals.

00:20.214 --> 00:23.790
Brush twice a day with fluoride
toothpaste.

00:25.170 --> 00:27.576
And clean between teeth daily.
